     6	under tmp_path (the real overlay + launcher bytes, a stand-in ``src/models/transformer.py`` carrying
     7	the real file's flash-attention fallback block, so no torch import is needed); the integration cases
     8	run the real launcher on this checkout (the real transformer, CPU only).
     9	
    10	Written by the exp_35 Coder (Claude Opus 5.5, max effort) per plan_orbitrir_yaw_evidence.md r2/r3.
    11	"""
