   117	  - `pass_c4`: Δ_C4(BF) ≤ 0.1 × Δ_C4(P1-pin). `pass_r`: |Δ_R(BF)| ≤ sd(m_Z BF). Both are checked for T60, C50, EDT, **FD**, R@1, R@5, R@10 at K1 and K8 — 28 checks, FD in the verdict.
   118	  - P1-pin Δ_C4 comes from the exp_25 JSON: K1 0.9223 / 0.1331 / 6.498 / 0.0059 / 0.647 / 0.7101 / 1.073; K8 0.9033 / 0.1337 / 6.807 / 0.0074 / 0.5523 / 0.7259 / 1.089.
   119	  - No exp_10 value enters.
   120	
   121	- **E3 (the registered `pass_c4` rule).** The verdict is the rule's. Non-binding expectation: it passes on T60, C50, EDT and FD; the retrieval rows are uncertain.
   122	
   123	- **E4 (expectation, kept separate from the verdict).** Expected: Tier 2-C4 PASS, T-dup exact; Tier 3 overall FAIL through `pass_r`, because B-F is C4-invariant only (the A6 45° probe was T60 +1.45 at K8 and +1.57 at K1); large 45° and R distances.
   124	
   125	- **E5 (descriptive only, no verdict; after phase (ii)).**
   126	  - B-F at 135° and 225° vs B-F at 45° (135 = 45+90, 225 = 45+180): same-pin s42 pairs, metric differences and dump relL2.
   127	  - CANON at 135° and 225° vs CANON at 0°.
   128	  - P1 vs angle.
