   165	## 6. Figure (`plot_yaw_curves.py --mode offorbit`, after phase (ii))
   166	**Layout.** Angles 0 / 45 / 135 / 225; six panels; FLAC / OrbitRIR / CANON, with CANON in a third style; K=1 dashed hollow, K=8 solid; mean ± sd (ddof 1) over s42–46.
   167	
   168	**Sources per angle:**
   169	- θ=0: FLAC from exp_25 P1-pin T, OrbitRIR from BF-pin T (H35), CANON from exp_25 T.
   170	- 45°: FLAC and OrbitRIR from the A6 CSV if E2 passes, otherwise from one-pin cells; CANON from exp_25 s42 plus CANON-45.
   171	- 135 / 225: the phase-(ii) cells.
