   183	
   184	**Chunk sequence (33 single-cell chunks; Planner decision 4), with the check after each:**
   185	1. CTL K1 → E1
   186	2. CTL K8 → E1
   187	3. BF T s42 K1 → E2
   188	4. BF T s42 K8 → E2
