   192	**Guard.** Read-only, on Yixun's `train_exp30_ACEattn_s43_20261104T061255_741947.log`, through a reviewed parser `exp35_training_guard.py`. s/step comes from the tqdm elapsed field within an epoch; windows align to the epoch's step counter; epoch-boundary validation is excluded. STOP if any of these holds:
