   609	
   610	    The vanilla + ``rotate_deg == 0`` name is byte-identical to the legacy
   611	    ``eval_FLAC`` output, so exp_01 / exp_02 artifacts reproduce exactly. A
   612	    non-vanilla ``cond_method`` inserts ``_<cond_method>_a<n_angles>`` and a
